	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_zoomIn zoomIn vision-box" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) Department at School of Engineering under Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam University, Indore, offers a career-driven postgraduate program designed to build future leaders in information technology. The program blends theoretical learning with extensive practical training in areas like programming, database systems, artificial intelligence, cloud technologies, and cyber security. Backed by experienced faculty, modern computing facilities, and strong industry collaborations, the department ensures students are well-prepared to succeed in the evolving IT landscape.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element mission-box" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ul>
<li>Contemporary curriculum aligned with industry requirements and new-age technologies.</li>
<li>State-of-the-art laboratories for programming, database, AI, and full-stack applications.</li>
<li>Skill-building workshops on trending domains such as Python, Java, Android, and ML.</li>
<li>Real-time industry projects and internships with IT firms.</li>
<li>Professional certifications in Web Development, Python, and Data Science.</li>
<li>Encouragement of research, publications, and innovative practices.</li>
<li>Regular hosting of hackathons, code challenges, and technical fests.</li>
<li>Support system for budding entrepreneurs and incubation of startups.</li>
<li>Proven record of placements in top IT companies.</li>
<li>Academic mentoring for higher studies like GATE, UGC-NET, and overseas education.</li>
</ul>

